### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"student@example.com","password":"LongPassword-123","displayName":"Студент"}

### Login — copy both tokens from the response to variables above
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"student@example.com","password":"LongPassword-123"}

### Refresh — replace BOTH tokens after success
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{refreshToken}}"}

### Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Edit profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"Нове ім'я"}

### Catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/components?q=мол&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Track milk
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/me/components/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"allergy","note":""}

### Track peanuts
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/me/components/6
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"avoid"}

### Personal list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/components
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Analyze text
@timeout 120
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/analyses/text
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Склад: молоко, цукор. Може містити арахіс.","productName":"Приклад"}

### Analyze one photo — place your file at ingredients.jpg next to this file
@timeout 120
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/analyses
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=FoodScanBoundary

--FoodScanBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="ingredients.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./ingredients.jpg
--FoodScanBoundary--

### History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analyses?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analyses/{{analysisId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Correct text (creates a NEW analysis)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/analyses/{{analysisId}}/reanalyze
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Склад: цукор."}

### Remove tracked component
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/me/components/6
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Delete analysis
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/analyses/{{analysisId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{refreshToken}}"}

### Process health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Database readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
